NOTICE - Third-party game assets

The MIT license above covers the source code in this repository ONLY.

It does NOT cover the Live2D model, textures, or any other art assets belonging
to the game "My Dystopian Robot Girlfriend" and its creator. Those assets are
NOT included in this repository. They are rebuilt on your own machine from your
own copy of the game by tools/recover_assets.py, and remain the property of
their original author.

You may extract these assets for local, personal use with this project. You may
NOT redistribute or republish them - do not commit them to a public fork, a
release, a mirror, or any other public location. If you fork this project, keep
webapp/assets/ out of your published tree (it is already in .gitignore for this
reason). Respect the wishes of the original creator.

NOTICE - Vendored third-party libraries

webapp/vendor/ holds unmodified copies of libraries that used to be loaded from
a CDN, so that a Jun OS install boots without internet access. Each remains
under its own license, not the MIT license above:

